# GuitarFreaks 11th Mix (System 573, digital I/O board): the first boot. The 573 BIOS boots the
# runtime CD (d39jaa02), which installs itself to the onboard flash and then to the 32 MiB flash
# card in PC card slot 1, with no inputs, then shows INFO 508 (install done, power-cycle) by
# frame ~26400.
game gtfrk11m

from 0 every 600 snap
at 28800 quit
